  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9aaaab5f-eb93-510e-9d26-b292af34822f" activityNameId="517cef34-ede7-5d01-b9ec-02c1edbb0e0b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Toner module, laser jet, b/w, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Toner module, laser jet, b/w, at plant
This dataset refers to a standard black toner cartridge with a capacity of 5'000 prints A4 and a coverage of 5%, specifically a HP C4096A for HP2100 printers. Original equipment manufacturer (OEM) manufacturing assumed, no remanufacturing. An update was made in 2023 to the manufacturing energy consumption. Weight: 880g plus 260g toner contained; Geography: European Electricity mix and material processing data for supplier outside Europe.; UUID: fcf9b068-15f2-351a-8f95-b8542a0130c0
Includes the manufacturing of the semifinished parts, toner powder, the material transport to the site, the assembly, the packaging, No direct emissions are considered.
Location: European Electricity mix and material processing data for supplier outside Europe.
Technology: Assembly of the semifinished components by OEM to cartridges.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fcf9b068-15f2-351a-8f95-b8542a0130c0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
